# Campaign site rules

This repo is **https://thewebisyours.org** (multi-page static campaign site), not `thewebisyours-template`.

## Stack
- HTML + `css/style.css` + `js/script.js` (+ page-local onboard JS)
- Web3Forms for forms; Cloudflare via `wrangler.jsonc` static assets
- No frameworks / no Astro / no npm app stack unless explicitly asked

## Do
- Colours only via `:root` tokens (`--cream`, `--ink`, `--terracotta`, `--sage`, etc.)
- Semantic HTML; keyboard-accessible controls; mobile at 375px
- Consistent trailing-slash URLs (`/privacy/`, `/terms/`, `/onboard/`)
- Prefer shared CSS/JS over copy-pasted chrome

## Don't
- Treat this as a single-file bakery template
- Add Tailwind/Bootstrap/React/Vue/jQuery
- Add ecommerce, booking, or CMS
- Change campaign policy in ways that contradict Privacy/Terms
- Migrate the separate volunteer template to a framework

## Pages
Home `/`, onboard `/onboard/`, privacy `/privacy/`, terms `/terms/`
